window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>I thought the past was behind me...but becoming Mrs. Bellanti put a target on my back.</i></p> <p>My husband isn’t a gentle man.<br> And God knows he isn’t the sharing type.<br> Rico’s announcement has dropped a bomb into my marriage.</p> <p>I never thought I’d see Rico again.<br> Never thought Dante would ever have to know.<br> Seeing the way he looks at me now, as though I’m just another problem to be handled?<br> It’s breaking my heart.</p> <p>I thought I was in love once before.</p> <p>I swore I wouldn’t make the same mistake twice.</p> <p>But falling for a Bellanti was far worse than a simple mistake....</p> <p><b>Book Two of Three in the all-new angsty, sizzling Broken series.</b></p>"; 
